@template dreamy

== career.missed
? tier>=colleague
- Your spot in the bay was empty today. Odd, how you notice a gap.

== worried.chief
? tier>=friend
- Is it heavy at the moment? Things get heavy. You can put some down with me.   #warm

== worried.captain
? tier>=friend
- I keep thinking the ship would be smaller without you. Please go tomorrow.   #serious

== worried.last
? tier>=friend
- Go to your shift, {nick}. Just the next one. Don't look further than that.   #serious

== career.up
? tier>=friend
- You look lighter. Like a window's been opened.

== farewell.eve
? tier>=friend
- Tomorrow you'll be stars away. I'll look out of the window and wave anyway.   #serious

== farewell.day
? tier>=friend
- Somewhere out there's a ship that needs you. Go and find it.   #warm
